=\"73-df-polynomial-hardness-and-completeness\">73-df-polynomial-hardness-and-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"79e0c730e7cd49f6\" href=\"?note=79e0c730e7cd49f6\" title=\"73-df-binary-pspace\">73-df-binary-pspace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.2–11.3, print pp. 487–501; PDF pp. 509–523; local resource/coding interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Lemma 13.9 and Theorem 13.10, pp. 344–346; scans 352–354"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"statement-compared-proof-outline-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TQBF}\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\">\\(\\mathsf{TQBF}\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"011094b454369426\" href=\"?note=011094b454369426\" title=\"73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth\">73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth</a>；多项式归约完备性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f8f8cd9bab9b1345\" href=\"?note=f8f8cd9bab9b1345\" title=\"73-df-polynomial-hardness-and-completeness\">73-df-polynomial-hardness-and-completeness</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{PSPACE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"79e0c730e7cd49f6\" href=\"?note=79e0c730e7cd49f6\" title=\"73-df-binary-pspace\">73-df-binary-pspace</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}pspace\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_{\\mathsf{PSPACE}}(\\mathsf{TQBF})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}pspace\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_{\\mathsf{PSPACE}}(\\mathsf{TQBF})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>深度优先依次求每个量词的两种赋值，只需保存多项式深度的求值栈，故属于 PSPACE。难度用配置图上有界可达性的递归公式：存在中点，再全称选择待核验的左右半段，使下一层公式只出现一次；如果把两次递归直接复制，公式会指数膨胀，不能构成多项式归约。有限项标签及一元变量编号与本地表示的大小保持多项式关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth","status":"resolved","id":"011094b454369426","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-polynomial-hardness-and-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"f8f8cd9bab9b1345","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-polynomial-hardness-and-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-pspace","status":"resolved","id":"79e0c730e7cd49f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-pspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth","status":"resolved","id":"011094b454369426","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{TQBF}\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*$ 见 [[73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth]]；多项式归约完备性见 [[73-df-polynomial-hardness-and-completeness]]，$\\mathsf{PSPACE}$ 见 [[73-df-binary-pspace]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-polynomial-hardness-and-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"f8f8cd9bab9b1345","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{TQBF}\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*$ 见 [[73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth]]；多项式归约完备性见 [[73-df-polynomial-hardness-and-completeness]]，$\\mathsf{PSPACE}$ 见 [[73-df-binary-pspace]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-pspace","status":"resolved","id":"79e0c730e7cd49f6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{TQBF}\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*$ 见 [[73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth]]；多项式归约完备性见 [[73-df-polynomial-hardness-and-completeness]]，$\\mathsf{PSPACE}$ 见 [[73-df-binary-pspace]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{TQBF}\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}qbf\\text{-}pspace\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_{\\mathsf{PSPACE}}(\\mathsf{TQBF})","display":true}],"bytes":1824,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-322","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-qbf-pspace-completeness|真 QBF 的 PSPACE 完备性]]"}],"outgoing":["011094b454369426","f8f8cd9bab9b1345","79e0c730e7cd49f6"]}